    "top-k-selection-markdown-code-1": "输入：input = [1.0, 5.0, 3.0, 2.0, 4.0]，N = 5，k = 3\n输出：output = [5.0, 4.0, 3.0]",
    "top-k-selection-markdown-code-2": "输入：input = [7.2, -1.0, 3.3, 8.8, 2.2]，N = 5，k = 2\n输出：output = [8.8, 7.2]",
    "top-k-selection-markdown-code-3": "#include <cuda_runtime.h>\n\n// input, output are device pointers\nextern \"C\" void solve(\n    const float* input,\n    float* output,\n    int N,\n    int k\n) {}",
